     <text:p text:style-name="P37"><text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Energy Enhancement</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2">: Increased energy levels and stamina</text:span></text:p>
